# Ultron, Artificial Malevolence: "it becomes a 2/2 Robot Villain creature" names the creature types in its own text, so
# Artificial Evolution changing Robot to Goblin on Ultron (CR 612.2, 612.1) makes the token a Goblin Villain, not a Robot Villain.
# Mox Ruby enters after the change and Black Lotus pays {2}; the token copy is a Mox Ruby that is also a 2/2 Goblin Villain creature.

